    "body": "Relay BB run pushed an update.\n\nPull request: #287\n\nTokens: 0 · Cost: $0.0000\n\nPushed to the existing branch `bb/relay-105-inbox-pipeline-06-07-confirm-reject-an-thr_c2g93czrgc` (updates PR #287), fast-forward `596e51b..604b435`.\n\n## Summary\n\nAddressed the two remaining medium-severity code-review findings on PR #287:\n\n- **Correctness (`db/pool.ts`):** a synchronously-throwing `runAfterCommit` callback would propagate out of `withTransaction` after `COMMIT` had already succeeded — misreporting a committed transaction as failed to the caller, and silently skipping every callback queued after the one that threw. Each callback is now run in its own `try/catch`, so all of them execute once the transaction has committed, regardless of an earlier one failing.\n- **Test coverage (`proposalActions.test.ts`):** added a test exercising `reviseProposalWithClient` from a `needsClarification` proposal (only `confirmed`/`rejected` are locked), verifying it transitions to `proposed` with the newly supplied envelope.\n\nFull workspace build and test suite verified green (311/311 tests) before pushing.\n\nRelay-Step-Status: pass",
