    "body": "Relay BB run pushed an update.\n\nPull request: #287\n\nTokens: 0 · Cost: $0.0000\n\nPushed to the existing branch `bb/relay-105-inbox-pipeline-06-07-confirm-reject-an-thr_c2g93czrgc` (updates PR #287), fast-forward `604b435..82119b2`.\n\n## Summary\n\nAddressed the newly reported medium-severity finding on PR #287:\n\n- **Correctness:** `confirmProposalWithClient`'s `pageContent` branch cast `envelope.properties` to `{ flavour: string; fields?: Record<string, unknown>; children?: string[] }` without a runtime guarantee that `fields`/`children` actually had those shapes. Extended `assertValidProposalEnvelope` to require `fields` (if present) be a plain object and `children` (if present) be an array of strings, so the cast at confirm time is now backed by validation enforced on every `pageContent` envelope. Added regression tests for both malformed shapes.\n\nFull workspace build and test suite verified green (313/313 tests) before pushing.\n\nRelay-Step-Status: pass",
